        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "08 - Primers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The cost of skipping primer is always higher than the primer itself.\nRepainting over bleed-through stains = 2 coats primer + 2 coats topcoat\nvs. 1 coat primer + 2 coats topcoat if done right the first time.\n```"
