      "text": "Handles:              Handles:              Handles:\n  ✓ Clean drywall       ✓ Bare wood           ✓ Smoke damage\n  ✓ Previously painted  ✓ Tannin-rich wood    ✓ Nicotine stains\n  ✓ Minor surface prep  ✓ Mild water stains   ✓ Pet urine\n  ✗ Stains               ✓ Failing surfaces    ✓ Markers/ink\n  ✗ Tannin bleed        ✗ Heavy smoke         ✓ Severe tannin bleed\n  ✗ Smoke               ✗ Nicotine            ✓ Water stain halos\n                        ✗ Pet urine           ✓ Odor encapsulation\n                                              ✓ Knots (pine/redwood)"
